  "releaseNotes": "Five XQuery fixes:\n      • fn:load-xquery-module closures evaluate body in captured static context, not caller's (Martin Honnen) — transitively-imported functions now resolve when invoked through the loaded module's function map.\n      • Library-module decimal-format declarations now propagate to the importing module's runtime DecimalFormats so format-number(..., \"lib:euro\") inside a lib:* function works.\n      • Cross-module declaration visibility: nested-import base URI swap, private-function injection, decimal-format re-key.\n      • General comparison: untypedAtomic → xs:QName cast uses in-scope namespace bindings (QT3 GenCompEq-22).\n      • element()/attribute() kind tests preserve full EQName URI + resolve prefixes against in-scope namespaces (QT3 K2-DirectConElemNamespace-78).\n      Also bumps PhoenixmlDb.Xslt pin to 1.3.20.\n      See RELEASES.md for full notes.",
